a with it and vegeta  looks down for the count  taken down by his own attack moore even  insults one vegeta's greatest attacks  so the prince of saiyans who's always  been a prideful dude and he was on cloud  9 just a few moments ago  he has now been completely embarrassed  and disrespected this is a crazy  twist at this point and it's making  things very interesting  morrow is the real deal not only is he  strong this goat man can now potentially  use all of our main characters as moves  against them  if he copies them imagine if someone was  stronger than you and could use all of  your moves  plus others it's truly seeming like a  hopeless situation at this point and i  like it from a storytelling perspective  the more opian opponent  is the more satisfying it usually is  when our main characters defeat him and  now things are seeming hopeless af and  as a result  i'm extremely curious and excited to see  how they'll get out of this one  piccolo then points out even worse news  since morrow can now use all of vegeta's  moves  he can use force spirit fission meaning  that vegito and gogeta  are not gonna be viable options even if  they are pushed to their limits  i mentioned last chapter that an enemy  could come around with this ability  and here we are a chapter later and  already that scenario is being put into  play  the possibility of using fusion to win  as a last resort  no longer seems to be on the table we  jump to bulma and others  as they follow the events from a  relatively safe distance  for now at least then they offers to go  so that he can help restore people's  energy he's totally down to sacrifice  his life  but he can't as the earth's guardian sit  by and do nothing  respect for him he has the mindset and  courage of a real hero  even if he's not one of the stronger  characters in the series  at the same time we see krillin who has  some senzu beans and he's trying to get  there too  in time so that he can help heal his  friends clearly we got back up coming so  all hope is not  lost even though things are not looking  great right now piccolo and gohan attack  together and i was worried that they'd  just get wiped out immediately  but we do see some cool combos piccolo  holds moro  in place by his legs gohan seemingly  traps him with an energy ring and then  super saiyan blue goku appears with a  warp kamehameha i love the teamwork  and the combos and how warp command may  have made an appearance  the result is that moro loses an arm  finally it appears like our dudes can  land some hits do some damage and  then bam next second morrow with a  delighted smile on his face regenerates  his arm  and stabs goku right through the chest  that's some serious brutal damage right  there  goku has that look in his eyes like his  life has all but drained out of him  completely moro explains that all the  abilities 7-3 copied  are now his forever with no time limits  wow not only was he kicking butt  but he was even hiding something like  that up his sleeve this dude can  regenerate  doesn't have a bead of sweat on him his  strong af can learn any move potentially  and all of our guys are dropping like  flies even goku who's usually the guy  that makes everyone feel safe and like  things will work out  all our guys have going for them is that  moro doesn't want them to die  yet since he wants to savor them as his  meals i gotta say  i'm a fan of moro as a villain he's  strong tricky and strategic  he's the kind of guy to have backup  plans and to hold back some of the aces  up his sleeves  definitely a worthy opponent gohan tries  to do something and fails miserably  piccolo is told by dende that help is on  the way  but morrow having the meccan powers now  picks up the message  what does he do he creates a barrier so  nobody can come through  he's not taking any chances he's careful  and doesn't want to give goku  or vegeta another chance to take him on  at full power both dende and krillin  are kept from helping and everyone is  kept from escaping  morrow proceeds to flex on everyone he  takes care of the androids without even  turning around  piccolo admirably prepares to sacrifice  his life along with the others  in the barrier since they're gonna die  anyways so that they could at least  take morrow with them he prepares to  unleash the biggest  ki blasts he can in the form of  self-destruction but again  moro gets piccolo with piccolo's own  move just like when he got vegeta with  big bang attack  he gets piccolo just like piccolo got  raditz ages ago  there are some great nods to previous  dragon ball sagas and moments  throughout this chapter and i really  appreciate that about this one  special beam canon took out raditz and  goku back in the day  and so piccolo is clearly on the verge  of death and goku is too with his own  chest whole  just as jock was the only one left to  stand against moro the beast  dende makes it through the barrier an  angel has appeared creating a hole in  the barrier  based on the staff and the arm behind  his back it appears to be whis  although we can't know for sure because  the face is purposely not shown  jocko starts to fire at moro who plans  to kill the patrol officer  immediately since he's so weak and not  even worth eating but another shot comes  off at the same time and unexpectedly  this one is enough to annoy moro then we  see that agent merus himself has  appeared and he imbued his own energy  into the shot so that it would be all  the stronger  more looks angered knowing that there's  more to merus  than just being a galactic patrol  officer and  mero smiles so we got a complete 180  here  we went from morrow flexing on everybody  to merus showing  up then they getting in to heal the  others and moro being irritated  meros as an angel is not supposed to  interfere but clearly he is going to  and it seemed to me that whis might be  present because of the staff and the way  whis holds one hand behind his back  that's not weird for 